BT /F2 14 Tf 54 711 Td (1. Executive Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 685 Td (Project Title: Smart Parking System / Park n Go) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 664 Td (The Smart Parking System is a full-stack web application for discovering parking locations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 650 Td (viewing slot availability, reserving parking slots, processing payments, and managing parking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 636 Td (operations through an admin dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (The project contains:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 601 Td (* server: Express/MongoDB backend API) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 587 Td (* user-dashboard: user-facing React/Vite app) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 573 Td (* admin-dashboard: admin-facing React/Vite app) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 559 Td (* shared-auth: shared auth/session utilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 545 Td (* client: combined or legacy frontend copy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 524 Td (Key capabilities include OTP login, Google login, admin login, slot locking, booking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 510 Td (confirmation, Razorpay payment verification, parking-location management, slot bulk creation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 496 Td (reports, users, vehicles, and payments management.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 468 Td (2. Project Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 442 Td (The system supports two main user groups: parking users and administrators. Parking users search) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 428 Td (locations, select slots, book parking, pay, and view history. Admins manage cities, pincodes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 414 Td (areas, locations, slots, bookings, users, vehicles, payments, and reports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 393 Td (A real-world user can search nearby parking, choose a slot, reserve it temporarily, complete) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 379 Td (payment, and receive a confirmed booking. Admins maintain the service area and parking inventory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 358 Td (Primary business value:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 344 Td (* Reduces time spent finding parking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 330 Td (* Prevents duplicate slot reservations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 316 Td (* Provides centralized admin control) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 302 Td (* Maintains booking/payment history) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 64 288 Td (* Enables structured parking inventory management) Tj ET
