BT /F1 10 Tf 54 200 Td (bcrypt hashes passwords.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 186 Td (Validation: express-validator ^7.0.1. Performs route-level request validation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 172 Td (SMS: Twilio ^5.5.3. Sends OTP messages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 158 Td (Firebase: firebase-admin ^13.10.0 and firebase ^12.1.0. Used for Google authentication) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 144 Td (verification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 130 Td (Payments: Razorpay ^2.9.6. Creates orders and verifies payment signatures in test mode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 116 Td (Frontend: React and React DOM ^18.2.0. Builds user and admin SPAs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 102 Td (Build tool: Vite ^7.3.1. Provides development server and frontend build pipeline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 88 Td (Routing: react-router-dom ^6.15.0. Handles SPA navigation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (HTTP client: Axios ^1.5.0. Performs API calls with auth interceptors.) Tj ET
