BT /F1 10 Tf 54 755 Td (The Smart Parking System is a complete full-stack parking management application built around) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 741 Td (React dashboards, an Express API, MongoDB persistence, JWT authentication, OTP/Google login, slot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 727 Td (locking, booking management, and payment verification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 706 Td (Its strongest implemented workflow is the smart booking flow: users discover locations, inspect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 692 Td (slot blueprints, lock a slot, initiate payment, verify payment, and receive a confirmed booking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 678 Td (while the backend updates slot occupancy state. The project is suitable for a final-year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 664 Td (engineering demonstration and can be evolved toward production with stronger testing, real-time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 650 Td (updates, hardened payment/auth routes, persistent OTP storage, and operational monitoring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 483 28 Td (Page 10 of 10) Tj ET
